// PoC1 UI — std-widgets 를 쓰지 않고 내장 요소만으로 구성(의존 최소화).
export component AppWindow inherits Window {
    title: "PoC1 - Slint + external wgpu texture";
    width: 960px;
    height: 700px;
    background: #0e0e12;

    in property <image> preview;
    in property <string> status-text;
    in property <string> metrics-text;

    Image {
        source: root.preview;
        x: 20px;
        y: 20px;
        width: root.width - 40px;
        height: root.height - 130px;
    }

    Text {
        text: root.status-text;
        x: 20px;
        y: root.height - 96px;
        color: #e8e8ee;
        font-size: 14px;
        wrap: word-wrap;
    }

    Text {
        text: root.metrics-text;
        x: 20px;
        y: root.height - 56px;
        color: #8be9a0;
        font-size: 14px;
    }
}
